type: dataset
title: "Visibility of Ukrainian brands in generative AI answers: audit data and code"
abstract: "Data and code for an audit of how generative AI systems mention 42 Ukrainian brands in five industries in answers to 80 unbranded consumer queries in Ukrainian and English: 4,000 answers from five systems, 800 Google AI Overviews, control collections, LLM-judge labels, market benchmarks and scripts reproducing the accompanying article."
